# Pins for deploy/docker/Dockerfile.rea-cold-worker. The Dockerfile ARG defaults
# are the source of truth; this file records them, and why, in one place.
# Keep both in sync. Evidence for each pin is in SPIKE.md.

# REA, built from source. Will chose a source build because the newest npm
# release (rea-agents 6.8.0) lacks the existing-project reuse mode
# (REA_GHIDRA_PROJECT_PATH / REA_GHIDRA_PROGRAM_NAME). The build self-reports
# "6.8.0", so it is identified by commit, tarball digest and catalog digest.
